The '''Dragon impling''' is the second highest [[impling]] that can be caught in the [[Impetuous Impulses]] [[minigame]], and are located throughout [[Puro-Puro]] and [[Gielinor]]. The player needs at least 83 [[Hunter]] to capture this type of impling (boostable). At level 93, dragon implings can be caught barehanded. Capturing a dragon impling grants 65 Hunter [[experience]] if caught in Puro-Puro, or 300 Hunter experience if caught outside of Puro-Puro, throughout Gielinor.

The Dragon impling is the second rarest impling for players to catch. Players cannot bring dragon impling jars onto [[Entrana]], as looting them may give weapons.

==Rarity==
{{Main|Impling#Spawn_mechanics}}
On the Gielinor surface, dragon implings have a 10/101 chance to appear out of a high-tier invisible spawn. In Puro-Puro however, a dragon impling only has a 9/301 chance to emerge from one of the high-tier invisible spawns.

For a more detailed breakdown of impling spawn mechanics, see the main article.

